{"info":{"name":"BMA-44 매칭 선호조건 API (S4)","description":"S4 매칭 선호조건 API 검증 컬렉션.\n\n회원가입 → 로그인 → 지역 조회 → 선호조건 조회/저장 → 실패 케이스 → 매칭 추천에 지역·나이 필터가 실제로 반영되는지까지 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다(앞 요청이 만든 토큰을 뒤에서 쓴다).\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n\n검증 항목: 시/군/구·시/도 전체 선택, 지역명 응답, 나이 19~99(최소 19 고정), 키 필드 부재(BMA-19 안건2), 인증 요구, 시/도 전체가 하위 시/군/구를 포함하는 매칭 필터, 나이 필터.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정과 새 닉네임을 쓴다. 반복 실행해도 깨지지 않게 한다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"pref-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"pref-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickA\", \"선호A\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickB\", \"선호B\" + (t % 100000));"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. 지역 목록 조회 (S4-04 데이터 소스 = S3-10)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"시/도 17개\", () => pm.expect(d).to.have.lengthOf(17));","pm.test(\"제주 하위에 서귀포시\", () => pm.expect(d.find(s => s.code === \"JEJU\").children.map(c => c.code)).to.include(\"JEJU_SEOGWIPO\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/regions","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","regions"]}}},{"name":"4. 선호조건 조회 - 미설정이면 기본값","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"지역·나이 null 키 존재\", () => { pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"preferredRegionCode\", null); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"minAge\", null); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"maxAge\", null); });","pm.test(\"matchingEnabled=true, maxDistanceKm=50\", () => { pm.expect(d.matchingEnabled).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.maxDistanceKm).to.eql(50); });","pm.test(\"키 필드 없음 (BMA-19 안건2)\", () => pm.expect(Object.keys(d).join()).to.not.match(/height/i));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"5. 저장 - 시/군/구 + 나이 25~35","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"SIGUNGU 강남구 / 서울특별시\", () => { pm.expect(d.preferredRegionScope).to.eql(\"SIGUNGU\"); pm.expect(d.preferredRegionName).to.eql(\"강남구\"); pm.expect(d.regionSidoCode).to.eql(\"SEOUL\"); pm.expect(d.regionSidoName).to.eql(\"서울특별시\"); });","pm.test(\"나이 25~35\", () => { pm.expect(d.minAge).to.eql(25); pm.expect(d.maxAge).to.eql(35); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\",\"minAge\":25,\"maxAge\":35}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"6. 조회 - 저장값 반영","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"SEOUL_GANGNAM 25~35\", () => { pm.expect(d.preferredRegionCode).to.eql(\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\"); pm.expect(d.maxAge).to.eql(35); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"7. 저장 - 시/도 전체(서울), 나이 제한 없음","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"SIDO 서울특별시, sido=SEOUL\", () => { pm.expect(d.preferredRegionScope).to.eql(\"SIDO\"); pm.expect(d.preferredRegionName).to.eql(\"서울특별시\"); pm.expect(d.regionSidoCode).to.eql(\"SEOUL\"); });","pm.test(\"나이 null\", () => { pm.expect(d.minAge).to.eql(null); pm.expect(d.maxAge).to.eql(null); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"8. 저장 - 없는 지역 코드 (400)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 COMMON_001\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"COMMON_001\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"NOWHERE\",\"minAge\":20,\"maxAge\":30}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"9. 저장 - 지역 누락 (400)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 COMMON_001\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"COMMON_001\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"minAge\":20,\"maxAge\":30}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"10. 저장 - 최소 나이 18 (400, 미성년자 범위 차단)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400, 최소 나이 메시지\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include(\"최소 나이\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL\",\"minAge\":18,\"maxAge\":30}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"11. 저장 - 최대 나이 100 (400)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400, 최대 나이 메시지\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include(\"최대 나이\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL\",\"minAge\":20,\"maxAge\":100}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"12. 저장 - 최소 > 최대 (400)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400, 순서 메시지\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include(\"클 수 없습니다\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL\",\"minAge\":40,\"maxAge\":30}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"13. 저장 - 키 필드는 무시된다","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"응답에 height 없음\", () => pm.expect(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json().data)).to.not.match(/height/i));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL\",\"minHeightCm\":170,\"maxHeightCm\":190}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"14. 인증 없이 저장 (401)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"preferredRegionCode\":\"SEOUL\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/preference","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","preference"]}}},{"name":"15. 프로필 A 저장 (서울 강남, 성별 M) - 추천 조회 자격","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/java